<title>USA: Valspar swaps businesses with Ameron.</title>
<headline>Valspar swaps businesses with Ameron.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp said Monday it has completed the exhange of its maintenance coatings division for Ameron International Corp's product finishes business.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the exchange between the coating manufacturers were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Valspar shares rose 3/8 to 58-1/2 Monday. Ameron fell 1/8 to 51-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
